WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:06.327
<v Privacy>Every record you write is private until you decide otherwise.

2
00:00:06.327 --> 00:00:11.991
Open one and the visibility is stated plainly, not buried in a settings page.

3
00:00:12.052 --> 00:00:18.315
<v Your audit log>Every time a leader opens your record, it is written here for you to read.

4
00:00:18.315 --> 00:00:23.163
You never have to ask anyone what they looked at.
